title: Notification permission bait
severity: medium
score: 30
tags: scam, push-abuse
attack: T1204.001, T1566
description: The page asked for notification permission with 'click Allow to
  continue/verify' coercion wording.
---
// The page asks for notification permission and tells the visitor to press Allow.
notification_bait_frames
| where exists(notification_requests)
| distinct url
